# Package F "The '94 Harley": Dizzy hires you. Flags: JobAccepted(old_harley), old_harley_paid, old_harley_bribed.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('old_harley_paid')
goto: Done

cond: HasFlag('old_harley_bribed')
goto: Bribed

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(old_harley)') && HasItem('harley_ignition')
goto: Return

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(old_harley)')
goto: Waiting

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: Somebody lifted the ignition module off my '94 Harley. Antique, real gasoline, the last one in the dome. Without it she's a sculpture.
#
o_text: Who has it?
o_id: old_harley_accept
o_goto: Accepted
#
o_text: Not my kind of job.
o_id: old_harley_decline
o_goto: Bye

name: Accepted
npc: Ratchet. Runs a chop shop in the west, parts bin by the back wall. Three hundred if you bring it back. He don't mean no harm. He just don't mean anything.
effect: SetFlag('JobAccepted(old_harley)')
effect: EndConversation

name: Waiting
npc: Ratchet. West. The module. She's waiting.
effect: EndConversation

name: Return
npc: (He holds the module like a newborn.) Oh, you beauty.
#
o_text: (Hand it over.) 300 sat, as agreed.
o_id: old_harley_give
o_goto: Paid
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: old_harley_keep
o_goto: Bye

name: Paid
npc: Three hundred. Come by when she runs, I'll take you round the dome. Twice.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'harley_ignition', 1)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 300)
effect: SetFlag('old_harley_paid')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: Ratchet's got a new jacket. Leather. Paid cash. Funny thing.
effect: EndConversation

name: Done
npc: Hear that? That's a real engine.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Keep the rubber side down.
effect: EndConversation
